# Oltec Archaeologists, first mode: "Return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand." (CR 700.2, 400.7.) Bot1's own Lightning Bolt
# kills its Memnite on turn 1, and Bot2 bolts its own Ornithopter on turn 2, so Bot1's graveyard holds an artifact card (Memnite) and a
# non-artifact card (Lightning Bolt), Bot2's one artifact card (Ornithopter). Five mana on turn 3 (four Moxen and a Plains) cast the
# Archaeologists: the only legal target is Bot1's Memnite (Bot2's Ornithopter and Bot1's own Lightning Bolt do not qualify, so it is chosen
# without a question) and returns to Bot1's hand; the Ornithopter stays in Bot2's graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Memnite
Lightning Bolt
Oltec Archaeologists
Plains
Island
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x4
Island x13

